// IchthysOS/AOSP-17: LineageOS's generated bootanimation uses `mogrify` (ImageMagick,
// external/imagemagick) which isn't synced. This device does not inherit
// vendor/lineage/config (so bootanimation.zip is not in PRODUCT_PACKAGES); the module is
// neutralized here to drop the undefined `mogrify` dependency during soong analysis.
